    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so basically you're saying i should just replace people with software. but won't that eventually hurt the company if we lose the human element or if my employees feel like they're just being phased out piece by piece? i want to make sure i'm focused on the most efficient way to scale, but i don't want to make a mistake that ruins the culture or my reputation. is it just objectively better to automate as much as possible as quickly as possible to stay competitive?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
