      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While automation can significantly boost efficiency, it's not a one-size-fits-all solution. Focusing solely on automation can lead to a loss of staff, undervaluing human expertise, and negatively impacting company culture. A balanced approach, involving both automation and strategic staffing decisions, is more effective in the long run. Consider pairing automation with retraining and reskilling programs to ensure employees remain capable and engaged.",
